# Code Quality Gate

When editing Python files in `examples/*/src/`, verify:

- Type hints on all functions and variables
- All agent nodes and endpoints are `async def`
- State is `TypedDict` or Pydantic model (not plain dict)
- `verbose_log("AgentName", ...)` in agent logic
- `setup_tracing()` called in app lifespan
- `/health` endpoint returning `{"status": "ok"}`
- `agent_common` imported from workspace, no cross-package relative imports
- No bare `except:` -- catch specific exceptions

Full templates and checklist: see `langgraph-example-implementation` skill.
